# Credential-bearing handover docs. MANAGER-GUIDE.md contains the manager's
# dashboard login in plain text. Ignored rather than committed-and-redacted,
# because a password that reaches git history stays there until the history is
# rewritten - and the file is genuinely useful to keep locally.
# Share these through a password manager or a direct message, not the repo.
